 a way of  approaching an answer it certainly is an  adequate answer to the question  well yeah no that was a great answer uh  thank you  and unfortunately there's this whole  question of science that's  developed that's you know with the  anti-vaccination uh  et cetera that we won't have time to go  to today but it's another important area  related  to science um but um  our time has come to an end so i wanted  to thank you administrator steiner  for a really fantastic conversation  today  i'd also like to thank lauren for  co-monitor moderating  dean kurth for her welcoming remarks  and you the audience for your engagement  and insightful questions  so thank you all for joining us today  and we look forward to seeing you at the  next event  of the yigh global health conversation  series  thank you so much thank you great to  have you
 

